{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"像握住对方的手，不知不觉越握越紧，船也更晃\",\"source\":\"原本只是轻轻握着另一个人的手，后来不自觉地握得更紧。……另一幅更晃荡的画面，是想用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下；但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈。\",\"type\":\"4\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把握手变紧和用力抱紧导致水面颠簸作为两幅不同画面，屏幕稿却把船变晃接成了握手变紧的结果。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"他还想靠近却怕要得太多，对方不知他多孤单\",\"source\":\"他还想靠近，怕要得太多；对方不知道他刚才多怕被嫌弃，他有点孤单。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿中对方不知道的是他有多怕被嫌弃，孤单是他自己的感受；屏幕稿却改成对方不知道他有多孤单，改变了人物真正藏着的心事。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"即使对方不需要，他也愿意陪着并【不再为喜欢道歉】\",\"source\":\"即使对方不需要他，他仍愿意陪着，不再藏着喜欢。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"不再为感情道歉是珠子里的音乐想象，定稿的故事只说他不再藏着喜欢，屏幕稿却把道歉及停止道歉变成了人物实际的态度和经历。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "429cc451-dc85-4558-ab89-c46bf2595bbc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T175613406573Z", "elapsed_seconds": 280.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T18:00:53.508294+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a77d409ef4c9b781d34d0d1f01b60de4ef37dfcd8ae79b8fe5430e467f655f8e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T175613406573Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6f92b60a0751473dd95f0e2a6a38a9faeb6753d2279085793dba3330dd02ff7d"}}}
